{
  "name": "WF03 [Gemini] - Gmail Email Triage AI Agent v1.1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "is:unread newer_than:1h -from:noreply -from:no-reply -category:promotions"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": false
        }
      },
      "id": "gmail-trigger",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger: New Unread Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gmail Personal OAuth2"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Poll Gmail mỗi 1 phút. Filter: unread, < 1h, KHÔNG noreply, KHÔNG promotions. Tùy chỉnh filter theo nhu cầu."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "email_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "from_email",
              "value": "={{ $json.headers?.from || 'unknown' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "from_name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.headers?.from || '').split('<')[0].trim().replace(/\"/g, '') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "={{ $json.headers?.subject || '(no subject)' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "body_text",
              "value": "={{ ($json.text || $json.snippet || '').substring(0, 2000) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $json.headers?.date || $now.toISO() }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "thread_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.threadId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-email-fields",
      "name": "Set: Extract Email Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Bạn là email triage assistant cho Software Engineer Việt Nam (làm việc với client quốc tế + nội bộ).\n\nClassify email dưới đây:\n\n<from>{{ $json.from_name }} <{{ $json.from_email }}></from>\n<subject>{{ $json.subject }}</subject>\n<body>\n{{ $json.body_text }}\n</body>\n\nOutput JSON CHÍNH XÁC (KHÔNG markdown wrapper):\n\n{\n  \"priority\": \"High|Medium|Low\",\n  \"category\": \"action_required|information|fyi|spam|personal|newsletter|notification\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive|neutral|negative|urgent\",\n  \"needs_reply\": true,\n  \"reply_deadline_hours\": 24,\n  \"summary_vi\": \"Tóm tắt 1 câu nội dung chính bằng tiếng Việt\",\n  \"key_points\": [\"Điểm 1\", \"Điểm 2\"],\n  \"suggested_reply_draft\": \"Draft reply ngắn 2-3 câu nếu needs_reply=true, otherwise null\",\n  \"create_jira_task\": false,\n  \"jira_task_title\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": \"1 câu giải thích priority assignment\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- HIGH: client urgent, blocker, security incident, deadline today, manager direct\n- MEDIUM: client question requires investigation, internal request có deadline > 1 day\n- LOW: FYI, notifications, automated, không cần action\n- create_jira_task=true CHỈ KHI email request CỤ THỂ task technical cần track\n- summary_vi: ngôn ngữ tự nhiên, KHÔNG dịch máy\n- Output JSON THUẦN",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        }
      },
      "id": "basic-llm-chain-gemini-claude-classify",
      "name": "Gemini: Classify Email (Chain)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Basic LLM Chain — root node để execute Chat Model sub-node trên main path. Prompt được move từ Chat Model sang đây. Output: { \"text\": \"...\" } — downstream nodes phải reference $json.text thay vì $json.message.content."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview",
        "options": {
          "maxOutputTokens": 1500,
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "gemini-claude-classify",
      "name": "Gemini: Classify Email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        500
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GEMINI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Gemini - Class Shared"
        }
      },
      "notes": "💡 Gemini version (models/gemini-3-flash-preview). Gemini node KHÔNG hỗ trợ response_schema natively — JSON output phụ thuộc vào prompt instruction. Nếu output bị markdown wrap, Code node phải strip ```json wrapper. Original Claude prompt được preserve để fair comparison."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse + validate Claude classification\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nlet rawText = '';\nif (response.message?.content) rawText = response.message.content;\nelse if (response.content) rawText = typeof response.content === 'string' ? response.content : JSON.stringify(response.content);\nelse if (response.text) rawText = response.text;\nelse throw new Error('Cannot find Claude response');\n\nrawText = rawText.replace(/^```json\\s*/, '').replace(/\\s*```$/, '').trim();\n\nlet classification;\ntry {\n  classification = JSON.parse(rawText);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Invalid JSON: ' + rawText.substring(0, 200));\n}\n\nconst email = $('Set: Extract Email Fields').first().json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...email,\n    ...classification,\n    routing_decision: classification.priority === 'High' ? 'alert' : classification.priority === 'Low' ? 'archive' : 'review'\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-classification",
      "name": "Code: Parse Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "high-priority",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.priority }}",
                    "rightValue": "High",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "HIGH"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "spam",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.category }}",
                    "rightValue": "spam",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "SPAM"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "low-fyi",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.priority }}",
                    "rightValue": "Low",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "LOW"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "MEDIUM"
        }
      },
